(24536,0,0,'No one expects the Dark Iron dwarves!',14,0,100,0,0,11832,'Dark Iron Herald'),
(24536,1,0,'We\'ll drink yer stout and lager,\nDrain all the pints and kegs!\nWe\'ll drink and brawl and brawl and drink,\n\'til we can\'t feel our legs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Herald'),
(24536,1,1,'So lift a mug to Coren,\nAnd Hurley Blackbreath too!\nThis drink is weak, without much kick,\nBut oi!  At least it\'s brew!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Herald'),
(24536,1,2,'And when the brew\'s all missin\'\nTa Shadowforge we\'ll hop,\nA bitter toast ta Ragnaros...\n... but bring him not a drop!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Herald'),
(24536,1,3,'Oh, we\'re from Blackrock Mountain,\nWe\'ve come ta drink yer brew!\nDark Iron dwarves, they do not lie,\nAnd so yeh know it\'s true!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Herald'),
(24536,1,4,'Yeh will not try our bitter, \nYeh will not serve our ale!\nBut have Brewfest without our lot?\nJust try it, and ye\'ll fail!\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Herald'),
(24536,2,0,'RETREAT!!  We\'ve taken a beating and had $3151W casualties!  We can\'t keep taking these losses!  FALL BACK!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Herald'),
(24536,3,0,'We did it boys!  Now back to the Grim Guzzler and we\'ll drink to the $3151W that were injuredl!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Herald'),
