(42021,0,0,'See those ships in dock?',12,0,100,25,0,21333,''),
(42021,1,0,'They\'re the only ones that have returned from battle, and they\'re being repaired.',12,0,100,396,0,21334,''),
(42021,2,0,'We pay the mercs to get us out there, or our troops get no reinforcements.',12,0,100,396,0,21336,''),
(42021,3,0,'Welcome to the military, recruit.',12,0,100,396,0,21337,''),
(42021,4,0,'Put all of that out of your head, recruit.\n',12,0,100,396,0,21343,''),
(42021,5,0,'I\'ve been fightin\' Horde for ten years now, and I\'ve never seen it worse than this.',12,0,100,396,0,21342,''),
(42021,6,0,'Just stay focused on the battle in front of us, or you won\'t live to worry about the rest.',12,0,100,396,0,21344,''),
(42021,7,0,'I stopped by the park district on my way here. There\'s nothing left of it...\n',12,0,100,396,0,21351,''),
(42021,8,0,'Aye. I was here when the dragon attacked.',12,0,100,396,0,21353,''),
(42021,9,0,'He could\'ve destroyed the entire city if he willed it. We were powerless to stop him.',12,0,100,1,0,22801,''),
(42021,10,0,'What drove him off, then?',12,0,100,6,0,21352,''),
(42021,11,0,'No idea. It made no sense...',12,0,100,1,0,21355,''),
(42021,12,0,'He flew in, torched the park, then just flew off.',12,0,100,1,0,21356,''),
(42021,13,0,'If you ask me, the beast is insane.',12,0,100,396,0,21357,''),
(42021,14,0,'I think I can just make it out from here. Right on the edge of the horizon.',12,0,100,25,0,21345,''),
(42021,15,0,'The new island - just surfaced after the last earthquakes.',12,0,100,1,0,21346,''),
(42021,16,0,'It\'s what we\'re fighting for. On this front, at least.',12,0,100,1,0,21347,''),
(42021,17,0,'This\'ll be my third time now.',12,0,100,273,0,21348,''),
(42021,18,0,'Toughest fighting I\'ve seen...',12,0,100,1,0,21349,''),
(42021,19,0,'We lose that island to the Horde and Stormwind\'s as good as gone... and they know it.',12,0,100,1,0,21350,''),
(42022,0,0,'Why must we ride to battle on a mercenary ship? Used to be that we\'d kill pirates as soon as look at them.',12,0,100,6,0,21325,''),
(42022,1,0,'That makes sense, I suppose. Just doesn\'t feel right...',12,0,100,396,0,21326,''),
