(46935,0,0,'The grand Crucible of Carnage awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46935,1,0,'Here we are once again, ladies and gentlemen. The epic struggle between life and death in the Crucible of Carnage! For this round we have $n versus... a really fat ogre? Wait, seriously?! That\'s all we could come up with on short notice? What am I paying you for? ',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,2,0,'Whatever, let the fight begin!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,3,0,'W-W-W-WINNER! We have a winner! Good job and stuff!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,4,0,'The grand Crucible of Carnage awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46935,5,0,'I\'ve got a LITTLE somethin\' special for ya this time, folks! You aren\'t half the man of this half-man! $n vs. the vicious Wildhammer... SULLY KNEECAPPER!!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,6,0,'This match is sure to be SHORT! Okay, okay, I\'m done. Let the bloodbath begin!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,7,0,'Ladies and gentlemen, these deliverers of dismemberment have come out VICTORIOUS! Bets on the next round start now! Let\'s get this money flowin\'.',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,8,0,'The battle is about to begin! $n vs. the vicious Dragonmaw, Torg Drakeflayer! I THINK he\'s vicious anyway - hard to tell. I just let him because they let us take over their old arena here. Here\'s hoping for some blood!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,9,0,'Painful but beautiful! Gurgthock gives you what you want! The best display of carnage in Azeroth. Show me some love, people!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,10,0,'Imagine my surprise when I was approached by the genius forsaken, Calder Gray, and propsitioned with a combatant made of all the best features of our previous champions... LITERALLY! Who could refuse a chance to challenge CALDER\'S CREATION?!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,11,0,'You know what they say... if you can\'t beat \'em, join \'em! And in this case, you won\'t have the choice! Cruicible of Carnage, I adore you so.',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,12,0,'OOOOOOOH! Check that mess out! Amazing win! Way to stick it through him!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,13,0,'OOOF! That one\'s gonna require the "scraper."',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46935,14,0,'Hailing from the semi-distant wreck of a landscape that was once Gilneas, our champion arises! Keep your pants up $n, you don\'t want to show this guy a full moon!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,15,0,'There\'s no denying it - they really put that dog down! So much for our former champion!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,16,0,'It looks like we have one more challenger yet to face though, so let\'s get those wagers in!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,17,0,'The Twilight\'s Hammer: happy to serve local nefarious schemes anytime, anywhere. And today is no exception! Our final combatant hails from the not so distant Bastion of Twilight! Or is it the Twilight Bastion... bah, who cares!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,18,0,'You all love to hate him, and he\'s glad to shower his hate right back down on ya. LETS... GET... BLOODY!!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46935,19,0,'I DON\'T BELIEVE IT! WE HAVE A NEW CHAMPION OF CARNAGE!!! Our big, bad beefy challenger has been defeated by a ragtag crew of nobodies! Incredible finish!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(46945,0,0,'All of the highlands belong to the Dragonmaw, even this pit!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46945,1,0,'Pitiful meat bags! Feel the full force of the Dragonmaw!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46946,0,0,'My little sister could best the lot of ya. This ain\'t no arena. This is a nursery!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46947,0,0,'Calder said that if I kill you, I get to have your parts!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46947,1,0,'Eww! Get away from me, you nasty thing!',14,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46947,2,0,'As you wish, Daddy!',14,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46947,3,0,'Oh! Too full... oh no... ',14,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46948,0,0,'Why hello chaps, I have a not so surprising surprise for you this eve.',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46948,1,0,'I dare say I\'ve had enough of this. Time to bring out... THE BEAST WITHIN!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46948,2,0,'Enough toying around! It\'s time to get my hands dirty!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
