(53991,0,0,'Keep it down, will you? I\'m trying to run a business here...',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(53991,1,0,'If you\'re willing to forget this crate thing, I can give you a good price on some recent arrivals from Uldum.',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(53991,2,0,'Fine, fine. I might\'ve given him the name of a private collector interested in that crate\'s contents.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(54021,0,0,'Stop evading the question, Quincy! I know the thief was here with that crate.',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(54021,1,0,'The contents of that crate are very dangerous and they belong in a secure vault, not in the hands of some well-to-do, but ignorant collector!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(54021,2,0,'When the guards pay you a visit, I\'m sure you\'ll have no problem explaining how you got your hands on those Uldum artifacts or that lovely painting.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(54021,3,0,'That\'s a start. And what about you, newcomer? You wouldn\'t be here if you weren\'t after the crate as well.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(54072,0,0,'Archmage Xylem does not bargain with the likes of you, ruffian. There shall be no payment!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(54072,1,0,'What\'s this, an intruder? Let\'s see what the artifacts inside this box can do, shall we?',12,0,100,11,0,0,''),
(54072,2,0,'This isn\'t supposed to happen!',12,0,100,431,0,0,''),
