(55832,0,0,'13 gyromantic destabilizers? Check. 10 gnumatic flangegrips? Check. Now where did I put my favorite wrench?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nodd Codejack <SI:7>'),
(55832,0,1,'Hmm. Only 2 tons of explosives for this mission? Seems a bit light to me. This seems like the kind of mission we are going to need way more explosives for. Like... goblin pyromaniac explosives.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nodd Codejack <SI:7>'),
(55832,0,2,'Only thirty gyrocopters? We are going to need way more than that before this is over.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nodd Codejack <SI:7>'),
